	If you are lucky, you'll find a wand of wishing with 3 charges
to start with.  I usually try for "3 blessed scrolls of charging" first
(the first wish isn't completely wasted that way), and then get a total
of 6 wishes to play with (two wishes, recharge, three wishes + 1 more
`you wrest one more charge ...' wish).  If you get a wand with only one
wish, you end up with 4 wishes (recharge, 3 wishes, `one more' wish).
You just have to hope you get the blessed scrolls when you ask for them,
as an uncursed one will (I think) only put 1 or 2 charges in the wand.


